      "statusChangeID": "64df2ec413718009212a1509",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "On top of videos, there is also already string loading: \n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/string-loading/\n\nand image loading:\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/image-loading\n\nNote that these do have specific limitations for security reasons, and may not fully include everything you're asking for because they are not raw, complete HTTP requests. Relaxing those limitations and exposing raw HTTP requests is not being considered at this time.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
